# Cloudflare credentials — used by the wrangler CLI in skill setup scripts
# (e.g. when storage-setup provisions an R2 bucket or db-setup provisions D1).
#
# Get an API token at:
#   https://dash.cloudflare.com/profile/api-tokens
#   Use the "Edit Cloudflare Workers" template, or a custom token with
#   Workers Scripts: Edit, D1: Edit, R2 Storage: Edit.
#
# Get your account ID at:
#   https://dash.cloudflare.com → the right-hand sidebar.
CLOUDFLARE_ACCOUNT_ID=
CLOUDFLARE_API_TOKEN=
